The setter is not on the decode hot path (decode uses the getters), so there is no safe internal micro-optimization to make; I keep the body identical to preserve exact behavior.

```cpp
    void SetSensorType(FIT_SENSOR_TYPE sensorType)
    {
        SetFieldENUMValue(0, sensorType, 0, FIT_SUBFIELD_INDEX_MAIN_FIELD);
    }
```